ack='For MUS 324 Audio Recording Techniques, the main goal is to create professional-grade recordings of acoustic music performances. In addition to in-class hands-on activities, there will be several recording assignments. The class will suit you well if you have an interest in recording musicians that perform acoustically. (This could be you playing or singing your own music, or it could be friends or fellow students playing chamber music or Jazz.) We will listen to your recordings in class. (This also means that the class won’t be a good fit if you have little interest in recording acoustic music or if you are unwilling to share your productions with class mates.)'
